    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckpool is a top-down shooter with roguelike elements, where you play as a rubber duck. Blast bizarre enemies with lasers and bubbles, dodge traps, fight bosses, and collect loot. Unlock unique ducks to uncover a hidden mystery. The game revives the brutal difficulty of classic arcade games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through <strong>nine maze-like maps (</strong>+1 secret or not<strong>)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over <strong>150 collectible ducks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold the story by collecting ducks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against  bizarre creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different power ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>soap loot</strong> and spend it on a slot machine or buy collectables directly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
